Subject: [PATCH 36/43] [3.1.1] [M156] [Canvas2d] Inline
 Canvas2DRecorderContext::DrawInternal into Draw

Original change's description:
> [Canvas2d] Inline Canvas2DRecorderContext::DrawInternal into Draw
>
> DrawInternal() was originally split out of Draw() in crrev.com/c/2842150
> so unresolved filter draws could be deferred via PostDeferrableAction
> during [NoAllocDirectCall] V8 Fast API calls. PostDeferrableAction was
> removed in crrev.com/c/5471803, and crrev.com/c/8551394 moved filter
> resolution to the beginning of Draw() before acquiring the paint canvas.
>
> Since Draw() is the sole caller of DrawInternal() and paint_canvas is
> now always non-null at that point, fold DrawInternal() directly into
> Draw().
>
